  "_doc": "The third-person combat stance, one profile per class of gun (the owner, 2026-11-23: a confident, aggressive, disciplined military combat stance; never a pose per gun). Read at runtime (SOStance.h). families: a gun's family (game_data.json archetypes' family) -> its class. combatSeconds: how long the gun stays up after the last shot, aim, reload or hit; raiseTime / lowerTime: how fast it comes up from relaxed and goes back down. Per class: readyShift / aimShift (cm, actor axes forward, right, up): where a long gun's butt rides in the right shoulder pocket at the ready and on the sights; readyDip: the muzzle's dip at the ready (deg); handHold / handAimHold: a handgun's grip from the shoulders' middle (cm); relaxOffset / relaxRot: the relaxed carry from the chest point (cm) and its turn (pitch, yaw, roll); elbowOut: each elbow's lean out from straight down (firing, support); elbowLeast / elbowMost: how far it may swing (radians from straight down, + out round the arm's outside); shoulders: how much of the collarbones' forward pull is taken out (0..1: square shoulders, open chest); blade / lean: the trunk turned to the gun and leaning forward (deg, ready and aimed); headDown: the chin down (deg); knees: the hips lowered (cm); stagger: the support foot forward of the firing foot standing (cm); width: the feet wider standing (cm).",
